flowchart TD
  Cron[07:15 IST workflow] --> Calendar[market-calendar]
  Calendar -->|closed| Closed[market closed state]
  Calendar -->|trading day| Ingest[Pulse/RSS/source ingestion]
  Ingest --> Rank[deterministic pre-score]
  Rank --> Rerank[agent reranker]
  Rerank --> Enrich[article enrichment]
  Enrich --> Guardrails[public copy guardrails]
  Guardrails --> Digest[archive daily digest]
  Digest --> Publish[static publisher]
  Publish --> Site[public briefing pages]

